window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Shifting has its perks. </p> <p>Rina has yet to experience even one of them. </p> <p>But that won’t keep her from trying. </p> <p><i>Lion Shifter </i>is the second book in an exciting new magic-filled urban fantasy, starring a girl with lots of moxie, fine brawny shifters, BFFs with questionable morals, and pygmy trolls in need of an attitude adjustment.</p>"; 
